    "Id": "vehicledef_APC_Sleipnir_SRM",
    "Name": "Sleipnir ISV",
    "Details": "A generic medium weight APC, the Sleipnir is a common sight across the Inner Sphere and the Periphery. The SRM Variant trades the Medium Lasers and most of the Infantry bay for a trio of SRM-4’s and 2 tons of ammunition.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       140     25\n<b>Left</b>         110     25\n<b>Right</b>       110     25\n<b>Rear</b>        110     25\n<b>Turret</b>      115     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      585    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Enhanced FPE</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 1 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "Vargr"
  },
